                                                "sense_id": "7c5b8a5e-2b6d-33f5-a586-978cc57dbdf3",
                                                "text": "1879, Herbert Spencer, Principles of Sociology Volume II Part IV: Ceremonial Institutions\nThe mutual bows and courtesies […] are remants of the original prostrations and strippings of the captive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99d3a9ff-340a-49fc-8c63-bba2e1a3ee77",
